  "fetch_scope_after": "MATCH (seed:Point) WHERE seed.id IN $seed_ids MATCH (s:Session)-[:CONTAINS]->(seed) WITH DISTINCT s MATCH (s)-[:CONTAINS]->(p:Point) WHERE coalesce(p.pointKind,'') = $chunk_kind AND coalesce(p.is_episodic,false) = true AND coalesce(p.content,'') STARTS WITH '[' AND NOT p.id IN $pool_ids",
  "fetch_scope_before": "MATCH (p:Point) WHERE p.session_id IN $sids AND coalesce(p.pointKind,'') = $chunk_kind AND p.lme_question_id = $q AND NOT p.id IN $pool_ids",
  "plan_barrier_after": "WITH DISTINCT s between the seed->Session traverse and the Session->Point traverse (code-review cycle-1 fix, c1e6f7f2d). GRAPH.EXPLAIN before: Node By Label Scan (p:Point) with seed.id IN $seed_ids applied LAST; after: the seed list is the driver. Result-neutral (DISTINCT only dedups a shared seed's session fan-out, which the row loop already deduped by id) and confirmed by re-measurement."
 },
