   "verdict": "PARTIALLY FALSIFIED (the reader surface does not rise, and the evidence metric moves only through the guard). evidence_recall@5 is NOT flat on this substrate (OFF 0.4667 pooled) and it RISES to 0.5167 with the guard ON while staying at the OFF level (0.4667) with the guard ablated - so the metric the feature exists to move moves, but the movement is the session-diverse REORDER's, not the injected turns'. reader_surface@5 is 1.0 in OFF and falls to 0.975 in the injection-only arm and 0.95 with the guard: a net REGRESSION (on S1, two questions lose half their marked items from the reader window). The superseded receipt's flat 0.00 evidence_recall@5 was a substrate artefact, not a property of the arm."
